  "display_title": "Dawning",
  "description": "Dawn, who lost his parents when he was young, visits the address of a letter from the past to know the circumstances surrounding the death of his parents. There, he met 'Hames' and lived with him. After a while, he felt affection for him. One day, as he spends his peaceful days with him, Dawn finds out that the person who killed his parents was Hames himself...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: The first story in Lezhin's Jungnyeon Danpyeonseon (중년 단편선) Collection.*",
